{"4470920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crack Mountain", "steam_appid": 4470920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you climb this mountain, you will be able to wish for anything. The best method to climb is by throwing a bouncy ball that can teleport you around. However, This ball is in fact affected by this thing Issac Newton invented... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong>... And <strong>Physics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaning it will teleport you off cliffs and to your doom if you are bad at throwing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don't be bad at throwing it, that's my advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Types of things you <strong><i>may</i></strong> do on the way up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a <span class=\"bb_strike\">cult</span> guild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swordfight a great warrior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape different dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb (optional)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you climb this mountain, you will be able to wish for anything. The best method to climb is by throwing a bouncy ball that can teleport you around. However, This ball is in fact affected by this thing Issac Newton invented... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong>... And <strong>Physics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaning it will teleport you off cliffs and to your doom if you are bad at throwing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don't be bad at throwing it, that's my advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Types of things you <strong><i>may</i></strong> do on the way up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a <span class=\"bb_strike\">cult</span> guild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swordfight a great warrior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape different dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb (optional)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You can wish for anything, all you need to do is climb this mountain... By throwing a ball that teleports you... Maybe try climbing too, I don't know I'm not the expert here.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4470920/6a9584a20e6c19d4be617731c31bfdd60132628f/header.jpg?t=1773750766", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4470920/90f455a3b93e72d4070d3daeb5257e9aa511976f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773750766", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4470920/90f455a3b93e72d4070d3daeb5257e9aa511976f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773750766", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 970/Radeon RX470 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 550 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Wyind"], "publishers": ["Wyind"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4470920